          "git_sha": "4d9fa636f44b7ed4b782987f0bca9909ecdf58b2",
          "line_end": 30,
          "line_start": 22,
          "path": "docs/architecture.md",
          "repository": "juyterman1000/entroly",
          "url": "https://github.com/juyterman1000/entroly/blob/9bab5850955cff6f1e374fada7227d45c9f2f570/docs/architecture.md#L22-L30"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_fa71be0f4906684b45fb31e9739ab2ba799df3deba0ae606525a3fd745ad959e"
      ],
      "text": "The design preserves provider protocol, headers, tools, parameters, ordering, and cache semantics, transforming only injected context and output; model/params/tools are never mutated unless transparent routing is explicitly enabled, and then recorded in the receipt."
    },
